 {
  "name": "S5 the leaf is considered present only above 0xD",
  "file": "examples/storage/cpustate.omni",
  "old": "  if max_leaf() < 13u32 { return 0u64 }",
  "new": "  if max_leaf() <= 13u32 { return 0u64 }",
  "tests": [
   "tests/cp10_state.py"
  ],
  "equivalent": "QEMU `max` reports a maximum basic leaf above 0xD, so `<` and `<=` agree on every CPU the suite runs; the boundary (a CPU whose maximum leaf is exactly 0xD) is not available under TCG"
 },
 {
  "name": "S6 the enabled size is read from ecx",
